        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/twoeyedjack/{size}/1945_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-01-10T11:09:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Unity has \"<span>deal a target&nbsp;</span><span>damage equal to the roll of your Robotics die\" under her Volatile Parts ability, which is close to my above phrasing and yet different enough to merit an interpretation that it is only a roll of one die and not a pool of dice.</span></p><p><span>I also noticed that in issue #6 the ultimate villain's second ability references rolling a... Power? Quality? Perhaps a category that applies to more than one Power?... that the villain doesn't have listed under its stats. Deliberately phrased vaguely so as to avoid spoilers. It is in both the print copy and PDF that I have.</span></p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:44:07.858Z",
